{"seq":2,"slug":"the-magnum-opus","title":"The Magnum Opus","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/peter-drucker/major-works/the-magnum-opus","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"management-tasks-responsibilities","title":"《管理：任务、责任、实践》","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/peter-drucker/major-works/the-magnum-opus/management-tasks-responsibilities","wordCount":1527,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-effective-executive-book","title":"《卓有成效的管理者》","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/peter-drucker/major-works/the-magnum-opus/the-effective-executive-book","wordCount":1434,"readingTime":6}],"introHtml":"<p>本章考察德鲁克的集大成与经典之作。《管理：任务、责任、实践》（1973年），是德鲁克管理思想的集大成之作，全面、系统、深入地涵盖了管理的目的、伦理与方法三个层面，被誉为&quot;管理学的圣经&quot;。《卓有成效的管理者》（1966年），则是一部篇幅不大却影响极为深远的经典，系统地阐述了&quot;卓有成效是可以学会的&quot;，成为面向每个人的自我提升经典。本章揭示这两部经典的不朽价值。</p>\n"}